flowchart TB
    subgraph 用户端
        Web[Web浏览器]
        APP[移动APP]
    end
    subgraph 负载层
        LB[Nginx负载均衡]
    end
    subgraph 应用层
        APP1[应用服务器1]
        APP2[应用服务器2]
    end
    subgraph 数据层
        Master[(MySQL主)]
        Slave[(MySQL从)]
        Cache[(Redis集群)]
    end
    Web --> LB
    APP --> LB
    LB --> APP1
    LB --> APP2
    APP1 --> Master
    APP2 --> Slave
    APP1 --> Cache
    APP2 --> Cache
    Master -.同步.-> Slave
